# ANTIPODE: rooms seen and upgrades found make the completion; the Crown's
# own hall counts only once Halloran is beaten, so a run with everything
# else stands at 98 % before the last fight.
seed 1
game antipode
wait 5
cheat newgame
cheat nofoes
expect explore == 1
cheat visitall
cheat allitems
expect explore == 98
expect items == 100
cheat win
expect explore == 100
expect cherry_run == 1
